=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  logforward several -------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Decided: no Figma frame. web-01.example.net runs Ubuntu 24.04,$
# whose logger is rsyslog. hardn's file forwards to hardn.yml's$
# three servers, TLS, TCP and UDP: a Server row each, the status$
# row their count.$
$
# Syslog Settings ##############################################$
$
  [+] Syslog               Configured 3 servers$
$
  Forwarding ---------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Logger               rsyslog$
  [+] Server               logs.example.net:6514 TLS Open$
   -  CA File              /etc/ssl/lab-ca.pem$
  [+] Server               192.0.2.51:514 TCP Open$
  [ ] Server               192.0.2.52:514 UDP losses unseen$
   -  File                 /etc/rsyslog.d/60-hardn-forward.conf$
   -  Set by               hardn$
   -  hardn.yml            3 servers$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Stop forwarding      Undo hardn's change$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-1 or q]:$
$
$

